---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | RiddlesMaster"
  description="Read the Terms and Conditions of service for the RiddlesMaster technical interview preparation platform."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-[#141413] max-w-none">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#141413] font-serif mb-6 leading-tight"
      >
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm text-[#6c6a64] italic mb-8">
        Last Updated: June 9, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#3d3d3a] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Welcome to RiddlesMaster. By accessing or using our platform, you
          agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms and
          Conditions of service.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          1. Use of the Platform
        </h2>
        <p>
          RiddlesMaster provides puzzles, riddles, editorial guides, and
          workspace environments to help users practice lateral thinking.
        </p>
        <p>
          You agree to use this platform only for personal, non-commercial
          purposes. Sharing account access, scraping content, or distributing
          platform solutions publicly is strictly prohibited.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          2. Subscription and Payments
        </h2>
        <p>
          Certain features of the platform, including unlimited riddle access
          and full solutions, require a Premium subscription.
        </p>
        <p>
          Subscriptions are billed on a recurring basis. All payments are
          processed securely, and cancellation policies are governed by the
          specific billing plan selected.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          3. Account Suspension
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate
          these Terms, engage in scraping, or attempt unauthorized database
          access.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
